 (self)</in-capmkt:RelationshipWithTheListedEntity><in-capmkt:WhetherEventOrInformationIsAnOutcomeOfBoardMeeting contextRef="MainD">false</in-capmkt:WhetherEventOrInformationIsAnOutcomeOfBoardMeeting><in-capmkt:DateOfOccurrenceOfEventOrInformation contextRef="MainD">2026-10-30</in-capmkt:DateOfOccurrenceOfEventOrInformation><in-capmkt:TimeOfOccurrenceOfEventOrInformation contextRef="MainD">19:00:00</in-capmkt:TimeOfOccurrenceOfEventOrInformation><in-capmkt:NumberOfPersonsOrEntitiesForWhomChangeIsBeingReported contextRef="MainI" unitRef="pure" decimals="0">2</in-capmkt:NumberOfPersonsOrEntitiesForWhomChangeIsBeingReported><in-capmkt:DateOfReport contextRef="MainI">2026-10-30</in-capmkt:DateOfReport><in-capmkt:TypeOfChange contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Appointment</in-capmkt:TypeOfChange><in-capmkt:CategoryForChange contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Senior Management Personnel</in-capmkt:CategoryForChange><in-capmkt:DesignationOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Senior Management Personnel</in-capmkt:DesignationOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:SalutationOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Mr.</in-capmkt:SalutationOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:NameOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="I_ChangeInManagement1">Hardik Thaker</in-capmkt:NameOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange contextRef="I_ChangeInManagement1">2026-10-30</in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange><in-capmkt:BriefProfile contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Hardik Thaker is currently with IDFC FIRST Bank as Deputy Chief Information Security Officer and leads the Bank’s cybersecurity transformation initiatives. He brings nearly two decades of experience across banking, financial services, regulatory institutions and global consulting, with expertise spanning cybersecurity transformation, AI, technology and  cyber risk, cyber resilience and cloud security. 
Prior to joining IDFC FIRST Bank, he served as Executive Director, Enterprise Security &amp; Resilience at GXS Bank, Singapore, where he contributed to building the security capabilities of its greenfield digital banks in Singapore and Malaysia. Previously, he held a security leadership and architecture role with the Monetary Authority of Singapore, Singapore’s financial regulator, with responsibilities spanning critical information infrastructure protection and the design of security architecture for commercial cloud adoption.
Earlier in his career, he led IBM’s Security Strategy, Risk &amp; Compliance practice across ASEAN, supporting organisations in strengthening their information security and risk capabilities. He has also worked with Deloitte and KPMG, advising clients on enhancing their cybersecurity maturity, including engagements associated with the Government of India’s National e-Governance Plan (NeGP).
He has contributed to industry and professional forums, including the Association of Banks in Singapore’s Standing Committee, as well as ISACA’s Emerging Technology Advisory Group and India Advocacy Task Force. He is a Certified Information Security Manager (CISM) and ISO 27001 Lead Auditor, and holds an MBA in Finance from Gujarat University and a degree in Mechanical Engineering.</in-capmkt:BriefProfile><in-capmkt:TypeOfChange contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement2">Cessation</in-capmkt:TypeOfChange><in-capmkt:CategoryOfCessation contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement2">Resignation</in-capmkt:CategoryOfCessation><in-capmkt:CategoryForChange contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement2">Senior Management Personnel</in-capmkt:CategoryForChange><in-capmkt:DesignationOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement2">Senior Management Personnel</in-capmkt:DesignationOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:SalutationOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement2">Mr.</in-capmkt:SalutationOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:NameOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="I_ChangeInManagement2">Nitin Chauhan</in-capmkt:NameOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange contextRef="I_ChangeInManagement2">2026-10-30</in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange><in-capmkt:WhetherTheFurtherDisclosureForResignationOfStatutoryAuditorOrDirectorOrKMPsOrSMPOrComplianceOfficerIsToBeFiledAlongWithThisDisclosure contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement2">false</in-capmkt:WhetherTheFurtherDisclosureForResignationOfStatutoryAuditorOrDirectorOrKMPsOrSMPOrComplianceOfficerIsToBeFiledAlongWithThisDisclosure></xbrli:xbrl>
